<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="400" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; bEditID:r3st1; color:#000000; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="550" cellspacing="5" height="400"><tbody><tr valign="top" height="400"><td teditid="c1r1" aeditid="c1r1" locked="0" id="c1r1" style="background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 12pt; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgb(0, 0, 255); border-style: dashed;"><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif"><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVkd&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Logo"></font></p><font style="font-size: 12pt;"><br><br></font><p style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Ref No: {!Case.CaseNumber}</font></p><font style="font-size: 12pt;"><br><br></font><p style="font-size: 12pt;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Dear {!Case.First_Name__c},</font></p><font style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><b><span lang="EN-AU" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: red;">Delay/Cancellation</span></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">I would like to apologise on behalf of Qantas for the &lt;cancellation/extended delay&gt; of your journey to&nbsp;</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Case.Arrival_City__c}</span></font><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;when flight&nbsp;</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Case.Flight_Number__c}</span></font><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp; was &lt;delayed/cancelled&gt;.</span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&lt;Delays/Cancellations&gt; frustrate us all. However, the safety of our passengers and people will always be our first priority and will always come before schedule. We do understand the impact this had on passengers so your patience throughout this situation has truly been appreciated.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-AU" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><b><i><span lang="EN-AU" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">If eligible for payment of delay/cancellation compensation add:-</span></i></b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">In assessing your claim for compensation&nbsp; in relation to the Canadian Air Passenger Protection Regulation SOR/2019-150, as&nbsp;</span><font style="font-size: medium;"><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Case.Flight_Number__c}</span></font><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;was initially &lt;delayed/cancelled&gt; over&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">&lt;insert time of delay or remove for cancellation&gt;</span><span style="font-size: 10pt;">, it has been determined that you are eligible for &lt;</span><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">compensation amount&gt;</span><span style="font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;per person.<o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><span lang="EN-AU" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><b><i><span lang="EN-AU" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">-If eligible for payment of delay/cancellation compensation and ticket refund add:-</span></i></b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Because you elected not to continue with your travel and receive(d) a refund, the compensation payable is per person. Refund of the air ticket will be made to the original form of payment that was used for the air ticket.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><b><i><span lang="EN-AU" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">-if ineligible for claim for delay/cancellation compensation add:-</span></i></b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">In assessing your claim for compensation in relation to the Canadian Air Passenger Protection Regulation SOR/2019-150 (APPR), as&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Case.Flight_Number__c}</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;was delayed/cancelled for&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">reason outside of Qantas' control</span><span style="font-size: 10pt;">, it has been determined that you are not eligible for compensation under the APPR because [insert reason:&nbsp;</span></font><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Case.Flight_Number__c}</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;was &lt;delayed/cancelled&gt; for &lt;</span></font><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;">reason outside of Qantas' control</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;OR&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Case.Flight_Number__c}</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;was delayed/cancelled for &lt;</span></font><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;">reason outside of Qantas' control</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;/ your arrival at your final destination was delayed by less than three hours].<o:p></o:p></span></font></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><b><span lang="EN-AU" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;</span></b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><b><span lang="EN-AU" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: red;">Denied Boarding ONLY</span></b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><b><i><span lang="EN-AU" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Customer receiving payment of denied boarding where airports where not able to process add:-</span></i></b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">I would like to apologise on behalf of Qantas that you were unable to travel on your planned journey to&nbsp;</span><font face="Arial, sans-serif"><span style="font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Case.Arrival_City__c}</span></font><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;on flight&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;">{!Case.Flight_Number__c}</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">Under the Canadian Air Passenger Protection Regulation SOR/2019-150, it has been determined that you are eligible for &lt;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 13.3333px;">compensation amount&gt;</span><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">&nbsp;per person.<br><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><b><span lang="EN-AU" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; color: red;">Payment of compensation</span></b><b><span lang="EN-AU" style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><br><br><i>- if compensation is being paid add:-</i></span></b><span style="font-size: 12pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;"><o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 0.0001pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><a name="_Hlk27393330"><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">The compensation will be paid to the eligible customer and directly into your nominated bank account. Please complete the attached Customer Care payment form.&nbsp;</span></a><span style="font-size: 10pt; font-family: Arial, sans-serif;">This can take up to two weeks to finalise.<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="font-size: 12pt;"><span lang="EN-AU">&nbsp;</span><b style="font-size: 12pt;"><i><span lang="EN-AU">&nbsp;</span></i></b></p><p class="MsoNormal" style="margin-bottom: 7.5pt; font-size: 12pt; line-height: normal;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="2"><br>Kind regards<br><br>{!User.FirstName}<br><br>Qantas Customer Care<br><br><img src="https://qantas--c.ap1.content.force.com/servlet/servlet.ImageServer?id=0159000000FSVke&amp;oid=00D900000010OOK&amp;lastMod=1521233610000" alt="Qantas_Logo"></font></p><font style="font-size: 12pt;"><br></font><p style="font-size: 12pt;"></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="color: white;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">{!Case.Thread_Token}</font></span></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">Qantas Airways Limited, ABN 16 009 661 901</font></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font size="2" face="Arial, sans-serif">10 Bourke Road Mascot NSW 2020 Australia</font></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><br></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><span style="text-align: left; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************** PLEASE CONSIDER OUR ENVIRONMENT BEFORE PRINTING *****************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-size: 12pt; text-align: center;"><font face="Arial, sans-serif" size="1"><span style="text-align: left;">*********************************************** Confidentiality and Privilege Notice **********************************************&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></font></p><p style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">This e-mail is intended only to be read or used by the addressee. It is confidential and may contain legally privileged information. If you are not the addressee indicated in this message (or responsible for delivery of the message to such person), you may not copy or deliver this message to anyone, and you should destroy this message and kindly notify the sender by reply e-mail. Confidentiality and legal privilege are not waived or lost by</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">&nbsp;</span><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">reason of mistaken delivery to you. Qantas Airways Limited ABN 16 009 661 901&nbsp;</span></p><p style="font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;">***************************************************************************************************************************************</span></p><div><span style="font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: x-small;"><br></span></div></td></tr></tbody></table>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>